1
00:01:30,566 --> 00:01:31,551
=Tigers Sniff the Rose=

2
00:01:31,551 --> 00:01:33,560
(Based on the novel of the same name by Yiren Kuikui)

3
00:01:35,260 --> 00:01:38,940
=Episode 15=

4
00:01:42,980 --> 00:01:43,980
Shang can definitely be saved now!

5
00:01:44,820 --> 00:01:45,940
How many people in the world

6
00:01:46,700 --> 00:01:47,940
could get His Majesty to issue a pardon?

7
00:01:53,460 --> 00:01:53,860
No.

8
00:01:55,220 --> 00:01:55,620
No, wait.

9
00:01:57,580 --> 00:01:58,580
I can't use this pardon.

10
00:02:00,940 --> 00:02:02,820
If even Father risks protecting him,

11
00:02:03,980 --> 00:02:05,460
Yu Cheng'an will never let him live.

12
00:02:06,700 --> 00:02:07,900
Fang Tong, stop the carriage!

13
00:02:11,500 --> 00:02:12,940
(Prince of Jin refuses to testify.)

14
00:02:14,020 --> 00:02:16,100
(Father's pardon would only
get Yan Shang killed.)

15
00:02:18,340 --> 00:02:20,300
(What other way is there to save him?)

16
00:02:22,140 --> 00:02:22,740
(Yan Shang...)

17
00:02:24,220 --> 00:02:25,460
(How can I save you?)

18
00:02:30,340 --> 00:02:30,740
Wanyao.

19
00:02:32,060 --> 00:02:33,780
I can guess why you've come

20
00:02:34,940 --> 00:02:35,980
to see me today.

21
00:02:36,860 --> 00:02:37,460
However,

22
00:02:38,580 --> 00:02:39,660
I can't go to Yintaimen

23
00:02:40,820 --> 00:02:41,780
and plead for Yan Shang.

24
00:02:44,060 --> 00:02:44,580
That's not why I'm here.

25
00:02:47,540 --> 00:02:49,900
I want you and the Court of Judicial
Review to petition His Majesty

26
00:02:50,780 --> 00:02:51,620
to punish Yan Shang severely.

27
00:02:52,180 --> 00:02:53,500
He must be sentenced to death.

28
00:02:55,220 --> 00:02:56,260
Wait, Wanyao.

29
00:02:57,140 --> 00:02:58,860
Yan Shang may have a sharp tongue,

30
00:02:59,220 --> 00:03:00,460
and perhaps he's made you furious,

31
00:03:00,740 --> 00:03:01,700
but surely not enough to deserve death.

32
00:03:02,460 --> 00:03:03,100
Why not reconsider?

33
00:03:03,660 --> 00:03:04,700
The petition should say

34
00:03:04,980 --> 00:03:06,220
Yan Shang showed contempt for the law

35
00:03:06,860 --> 00:03:08,260
by publicly killing
a senior palace attendant.

36
00:03:08,740 --> 00:03:09,580
His crime is unforgivable.

37
00:03:10,100 --> 00:03:11,020
He should be sentenced at once

38
00:03:11,300 --> 00:03:11,940
and executed immediately.

39
00:03:12,780 --> 00:03:13,780
Don't let your anger
get the better of you.

40
00:03:14,900 --> 00:03:15,620
Isn't Yan Shang

41
00:03:16,460 --> 00:03:17,340
your man?

42
00:03:23,220 --> 00:03:24,100
Yan Shang is my man.

43
00:03:25,380 --> 00:03:27,740
But he's committed such a terrible crime

44
00:03:28,580 --> 00:03:29,780
that I can't protect him anymore.

45
00:03:30,940 --> 00:03:32,100
If he's doomed to die,

46
00:03:33,100 --> 00:03:35,500
why not make his death mean something?

47
00:03:38,820 --> 00:03:39,500
Mean what?

48
00:03:42,820 --> 00:03:44,260
Yu Cheng'an is seizing land
for a hunting ground.

49
00:03:44,860 --> 00:03:46,100
The people of the capital are furious.

50
00:03:46,940 --> 00:03:48,220
But their anger is directed
at Zheng Xing.

51
00:03:48,900 --> 00:03:50,740
He's the one they want dead.

52
00:03:51,380 --> 00:03:52,820
Lord Yu remains safely
behind the scenes.

53
00:03:53,820 --> 00:03:54,820
If I'm right,

54
00:03:55,220 --> 00:03:56,380
once Zheng Xing finishes his work

55
00:03:56,780 --> 00:03:58,100
and provokes public outrage,

56
00:03:58,420 --> 00:03:59,940
Yu Cheng'an will have him killed

57
00:04:00,980 --> 00:04:01,820
to appear just

58
00:04:02,100 --> 00:04:02,940
and calm the public.

59
00:04:03,700 --> 00:04:06,300
But Yan Shang has already
killed Zheng Xing.

60
00:04:07,420 --> 00:04:09,060
If the Court petitions for Yan Shang's
immediate execution,

61
00:04:09,740 --> 00:04:11,020
everyone will realize

62
00:04:11,780 --> 00:04:13,420
that this unjust verdict

63
00:04:13,900 --> 00:04:16,260
is only because Zheng Xing
served Yu Cheng'an.

64
00:04:16,940 --> 00:04:19,340
Then the true culprit
behind the land seizures

65
00:04:20,100 --> 00:04:20,940
and the people's suffering

66
00:04:21,620 --> 00:04:22,580
will be exposed as Yu Cheng'an.

67
00:04:24,380 --> 00:04:26,220
Zheng Xing was meant
to be Yu Cheng'an's scapegoat.

68
00:04:27,180 --> 00:04:28,660
But now that he's dead,

69
00:04:29,420 --> 00:04:30,420
we can pin the blame

70
00:04:31,020 --> 00:04:32,180
squarely on Yu Cheng'an.

71
00:04:32,740 --> 00:04:33,180
Brilliant!

72
00:04:35,180 --> 00:04:35,580
But...

73
00:04:35,900 --> 00:04:37,340
Is there really no way
to save Yan Shang?

74
00:04:37,980 --> 00:04:38,540
What if...

75
00:04:38,540 --> 00:04:39,700
Wanyao's plan is excellent.

76
00:04:40,740 --> 00:04:41,660
You are a master strategist.

77
00:04:42,700 --> 00:04:43,300
You may go now.

78
00:04:43,940 --> 00:04:45,100
I'll instruct the Court
of Judicial Review

79
00:04:45,580 --> 00:04:46,500
to proceed exactly as you suggested.

80
00:04:53,580 --> 00:04:55,460
(Whether this plan succeeds or fails,)

81
00:04:56,020 --> 00:04:57,460
(whether Yan Shang lives or dies,)

82
00:04:57,900 --> 00:04:58,900
(I have nothing to lose.)

83
00:04:59,700 --> 00:05:00,860
(I might as well give it a try.)

84
00:05:16,380 --> 00:05:17,980
Then I'll await your good news.

85
00:05:31,060 --> 00:05:32,380
(You must appear to want Yan Shang dead)

86
00:05:33,820 --> 00:05:35,140
(so he can keep Yan Shang alive.)

87
00:05:37,260 --> 00:05:38,180
(Only then)

88
00:05:39,660 --> 00:05:41,620
(will Yan Shang have a chance
to survive.)

89
00:06:13,580 --> 00:06:14,340
I...

90
00:06:15,620 --> 00:06:16,980
have important information to report.

91
00:06:19,060 --> 00:06:19,420
No need.

92
00:06:21,540 --> 00:06:24,500
It'll only be some fabricated nonsense,

93
00:06:25,220 --> 00:06:26,300
wrapped in clever words,

94
00:06:26,740 --> 00:06:29,020
in a desperate attempt
to save your life.

95
00:06:30,100 --> 00:06:30,820
Save your breath.

96
00:06:35,900 --> 00:06:36,820
Then, Lord Yu,

97
00:06:38,460 --> 00:06:40,060
why have you come today?

98
00:06:44,900 --> 00:06:46,060
You want to know

99
00:06:47,340 --> 00:06:48,780
why I killed Zheng Xing,

100
00:06:50,260 --> 00:06:52,500
and why I publicly

101
00:06:53,420 --> 00:06:54,620
confessed to the crime.

102
00:06:57,660 --> 00:06:58,180
Clever.

103
00:06:59,660 --> 00:07:00,700
I killed Zheng Xing

104
00:07:02,380 --> 00:07:03,860
to protect your reputation.

105
00:07:05,460 --> 00:07:06,460
Flattery.

106
00:07:08,020 --> 00:07:11,900
Zheng Xing terrorized villagers,
seized land, and demolished homes.

107
00:07:13,260 --> 00:07:15,100
Countless families were destroyed.

108
00:07:15,900 --> 00:07:17,380
The people were outraged.

109
00:07:19,580 --> 00:07:20,260
I killed him

110
00:07:21,580 --> 00:07:22,900
not to dispense divine justice,

111
00:07:23,700 --> 00:07:24,820
but to rid the Imperial Court

112
00:07:25,780 --> 00:07:26,820
of a traitor.

113
00:07:28,100 --> 00:07:29,220
And to help you

114
00:07:29,940 --> 00:07:31,540
earn merit and build your reputation.

115
00:07:38,900 --> 00:07:39,340
Merit?

116
00:07:41,900 --> 00:07:42,220
Reputation?

117
00:07:44,020 --> 00:07:44,740
Have I ever had either?

118
00:07:46,020 --> 00:07:47,180
Do I even care?

119
00:07:47,820 --> 00:07:48,500
You do.

120
00:07:49,700 --> 00:07:50,860
And you certainly will care.

121
00:07:52,300 --> 00:07:52,820
After all,

122
00:07:54,180 --> 00:07:56,420
one day, you will hold supreme power.

123
00:08:04,540 --> 00:08:05,380
Utter nonsense!

124
00:08:07,980 --> 00:08:10,220
What absolute nonsense.

125
00:08:16,140 --> 00:08:16,820
Lord Yu,

126
00:08:17,540 --> 00:08:19,740
are you really laughing at my nonsense?

127
00:08:21,620 --> 00:08:24,500
Or at the secret everyone already knows,

128
00:08:25,180 --> 00:08:27,060
which will soon become reality?

129
00:08:41,180 --> 00:08:43,540
Let it be known to all:

130
00:08:44,700 --> 00:08:46,580
I, Yan Shang,

131
00:08:47,300 --> 00:08:49,700
killed Zheng Xing today.

132
00:08:51,100 --> 00:08:54,140
Princess Danyang herself is escorting me

133
00:08:55,140 --> 00:08:56,300
back to the city to surrender.

134
00:08:59,580 --> 00:09:00,580
Those were your words, weren't they?

135
00:09:01,140 --> 00:09:01,620
Yes.

136
00:09:24,020 --> 00:09:24,860
Can you

137
00:09:27,100 --> 00:09:30,220
really draw a bow with over
a one-dan pull?

138
00:09:36,660 --> 00:09:37,540
A scholar

139
00:09:39,820 --> 00:09:41,620
is trained in the Six Arts.

140
00:09:44,260 --> 00:09:45,340
Archery and horsemanship

141
00:09:46,260 --> 00:09:47,060
are no challenge to me.

142
00:09:55,020 --> 00:09:55,500
Good.

143
00:09:56,540 --> 00:09:56,860
Very good.

144
00:09:58,900 --> 00:10:00,460
Then tell me,

145
00:10:01,700 --> 00:10:02,740
why did you

146
00:10:03,860 --> 00:10:05,500
publicly confess to your crime?

147
00:10:11,860 --> 00:10:13,220
I confessed in public

148
00:10:15,180 --> 00:10:16,300
to save my own life.

149
00:10:18,300 --> 00:10:19,540
I'm merely a scholar,

150
00:10:21,100 --> 00:10:22,300
with no influence

151
00:10:22,700 --> 00:10:23,740
and nothing to my name.

152
00:10:25,300 --> 00:10:26,340
To save myself,

153
00:10:27,420 --> 00:10:29,100
I had to use whatever influence I could,

154
00:10:30,140 --> 00:10:31,140
turning to public opinion

155
00:10:31,740 --> 00:10:32,620
and the people's voices

156
00:10:33,580 --> 00:10:34,900
to gamble on a slim chance of survival,

157
00:10:37,940 --> 00:10:39,180
and gamble that you would care.

158
00:10:41,340 --> 00:10:41,700
Good!

159
00:10:43,060 --> 00:10:44,860
Quite the scholar you are.

160
00:10:48,340 --> 00:10:50,620
You dared to manipulate public sentiment

161
00:10:51,580 --> 00:10:52,780
to achieve two goals at once.

162
00:10:55,220 --> 00:10:56,100
Such extraordinary nerve.

163
00:12:39,300 --> 00:12:39,700
Zhang Wencai,

164
00:12:40,780 --> 00:12:42,300
would you sign this petition?

165
00:12:43,700 --> 00:12:44,780
It's a petition seeking clemency

166
00:12:44,900 --> 00:12:46,020
for Yan Shang, the Third-Place Scholar.

167
00:12:47,180 --> 00:12:47,620
I know.

168
00:12:50,180 --> 00:12:51,620
(Zhang Wencai)

169
00:12:52,140 --> 00:12:53,020
I'm a scholar of the classics.

170
00:12:53,380 --> 00:12:54,860
I'm not afraid of those
scheming scoundrels.

171
00:12:55,380 --> 00:12:55,860
But

172
00:12:56,700 --> 00:12:57,660
a petition signed by

173
00:12:57,660 --> 00:12:59,100
a few hundred students
in the Imperial Academy

174
00:12:59,820 --> 00:13:00,860
may not carry enough weight.

175
00:13:02,300 --> 00:13:02,780
Fellow scholars!

176
00:13:03,420 --> 00:13:04,820
Come sign the petition!

177
00:13:05,060 --> 00:13:05,780
(All right! We'll all sign!)

178
00:13:05,780 --> 00:13:06,180
(All right!)

179
00:13:06,940 --> 00:13:07,340
(I'll sign too!)

180
00:13:08,860 --> 00:13:09,340
(Let me sign first!)

181
00:13:10,460 --> 00:13:11,100
(Count me in!)

182
00:13:11,260 --> 00:13:11,660
Thank you.

183
00:13:12,900 --> 00:13:13,300
(It's the least we can do.)

184
00:13:13,300 --> 00:13:13,660
Thank you!

185
00:13:13,860 --> 00:13:14,180
(My turn!)

186
00:13:14,580 --> 00:13:14,860
(Of course!)

187
00:13:14,860 --> 00:13:15,420
Thank you, everyone!

188
00:13:15,700 --> 00:13:16,220
(I'll sign too!)

189
00:13:17,380 --> 00:13:17,780
(Me too!)

190
00:13:17,900 --> 00:13:20,220
(Lin Mei)

191
00:13:22,300 --> 00:13:23,620
When Yan Shang returned to the city,

192
00:13:24,340 --> 00:13:25,380
I saw many commoners following him.

193
00:13:25,700 --> 00:13:26,740
Why don't we seek them out

194
00:13:27,060 --> 00:13:28,900
and submit a petition signed
by the people?

195
00:13:29,460 --> 00:13:30,020
Good idea!

196
00:13:31,420 --> 00:13:31,980
Brilliant!

197
00:13:31,980 --> 00:13:32,540
(It's our duty!)

198
00:13:32,540 --> 00:13:33,300
A people's petition.

199
00:13:33,300 --> 00:13:34,060
- (Exactly!)
- (That's right!)

200
00:13:35,140 --> 00:13:36,260
Prince of Jin is recovering
from his injuries.

201
00:13:36,460 --> 00:13:37,820
He's clearly determined
to stay in hiding.

202
00:13:38,340 --> 00:13:39,300
There's no movement
at the palace either.

203
00:13:39,940 --> 00:13:42,020
His Majesty spends his days
playing chess with Chancellor Liu,

204
00:13:42,260 --> 00:13:43,740
as though he hasn't heard
about the matter.

205
00:13:44,100 --> 00:13:46,300
Or perhaps he's pretending not to know.

206
00:13:47,340 --> 00:13:49,860
The princess has refused all visitors
these past few days.

207
00:13:50,020 --> 00:13:51,940
She's lost her newly acquired
male favorite.

208
00:13:52,100 --> 00:13:52,700
By now,

209
00:13:53,220 --> 00:13:54,860
she's probably grieving all alone.

210
00:13:55,580 --> 00:13:57,220
But the Crown Prince's
reaction this time

211
00:13:57,980 --> 00:13:58,820
is rather interesting.

212
00:14:02,980 --> 00:14:05,460
Those foolish Imperial Academy
students keep making a fuss.

213
00:14:05,580 --> 00:14:07,100
They're planning some kind of
people's petition.

214
00:14:07,340 --> 00:14:08,380
Are we just going to ignore them?

215
00:14:08,540 --> 00:14:09,300
Do nothing at all?

216
00:14:10,060 --> 00:14:10,940
Imperial Academy students

217
00:14:11,940 --> 00:14:13,740
speaking up for the people...

218
00:14:14,540 --> 00:14:16,140
Isn't that the very spirit
of a true scholar?

219
00:14:20,500 --> 00:14:21,860
There's nothing to worry about.

220
00:14:22,220 --> 00:14:24,180
Even if the Emperor himself
issues a pardon,

221
00:14:24,180 --> 00:14:25,540
I couldn't care less.

222
00:14:25,980 --> 00:14:28,020
Let them petition all they want.

223
00:14:29,700 --> 00:14:30,780
Zidu, continue.

224
00:14:31,660 --> 00:14:33,020
The Court of Judicial Review
submitted a petition yesterday,

225
00:14:33,020 --> 00:14:34,980
calling Zheng Xing a pillar
of the imperial court

226
00:14:35,140 --> 00:14:36,100
who was unjustly murdered.

227
00:14:36,340 --> 00:14:38,220
Yan Shang's crime is unforgivable.

228
00:14:38,500 --> 00:14:39,700
They demand an immediate sentence

229
00:14:40,180 --> 00:14:40,860
and swift execution.

230
00:14:41,420 --> 00:14:42,460
Isn't that perfect?

231
00:14:43,060 --> 00:14:44,380
Even the Court of Judicial Review
has spoken.

232
00:14:44,700 --> 00:14:46,500
I say we execute the fellow

233
00:14:46,780 --> 00:14:47,700
before things get complicated.

234
00:14:50,740 --> 00:14:51,700
You foolish boy.

235
00:14:52,300 --> 00:14:53,820
Yan Shang is in Yintaimen.

236
00:14:54,180 --> 00:14:55,500
If we execute him
for killing Zheng Xing,

237
00:14:55,620 --> 00:14:58,260
Lord Yu would inherit all
the public hatred Zheng Xing earned.

238
00:14:58,980 --> 00:14:59,740
Then,

239
00:15:00,140 --> 00:15:03,460
Lord Yu will be branded the greatest
villain who oppresses the people.

240
00:15:05,860 --> 00:15:08,420
The Crown Prince has played
quite a clever trick.

241
00:15:08,700 --> 00:15:09,820
The heir to the throne,

242
00:15:10,340 --> 00:15:11,380
yet so vicious.

243
00:15:12,060 --> 00:15:14,620
The Crown Prince is truly devious!

244
00:15:18,220 --> 00:15:18,820
But Father,

245
00:15:20,300 --> 00:15:21,260
since when have you

246
00:15:21,900 --> 00:15:24,100
cared what the common people think?

247
00:15:25,220 --> 00:15:26,780
Times have changed.

248
00:15:27,860 --> 00:15:28,420
And tomorrow

249
00:15:29,380 --> 00:15:30,820
will still be different.

250
00:15:32,660 --> 00:15:33,060
Father,

251
00:15:34,340 --> 00:15:35,380
tell me what to do.

252
00:15:35,740 --> 00:15:37,940
How should we handle this?

253
00:15:39,100 --> 00:15:39,980
Yan Shang...

254
00:15:40,700 --> 00:15:41,580
Should we execute him

255
00:15:42,220 --> 00:15:43,060
or release him?

256
00:15:45,180 --> 00:15:45,860
In a few days,

257
00:15:47,060 --> 00:15:49,260
just say the case is closed.

258
00:15:50,900 --> 00:15:51,660
Let him go.

259
00:15:52,140 --> 00:15:52,540
Father,

260
00:15:52,820 --> 00:15:54,380
we had grounds to arrest him.

261
00:15:54,540 --> 00:15:56,100
We need grounds to release him too.

262
00:15:56,500 --> 00:15:57,380
What do you suggest?

263
00:15:58,020 --> 00:15:59,540
Didn't you just say

264
00:16:00,140 --> 00:16:02,580
the Imperial Academy students
were petitioning for the people?

265
00:16:10,620 --> 00:16:13,620
Moved by the people's pleas,

266
00:16:15,700 --> 00:16:16,580
Yintaimen conducted
a thorough investigation

267
00:16:17,060 --> 00:16:18,020
and uncovered the truth.

268
00:16:18,620 --> 00:16:19,820
Zheng Xing deserved his fate.

269
00:16:20,220 --> 00:16:21,060
Yan Shang is innocent.

270
00:16:21,500 --> 00:16:21,980
Clever.

271
00:16:22,580 --> 00:16:23,740
But you're missing one line.

272
00:16:24,220 --> 00:16:26,020
We were not swayed by the Crown Prince.

273
00:16:27,780 --> 00:16:28,180
Understood.

274
00:16:28,820 --> 00:16:29,700
I'll see to it at once.

275
00:16:30,380 --> 00:16:31,100
One moment, sir.

276
00:16:32,940 --> 00:16:34,260
Remember to tell
the Investigation Office

277
00:16:34,460 --> 00:16:35,460
to treat Yan Shang's injuries

278
00:16:36,380 --> 00:16:37,260
and keep him alive.

279
00:16:37,500 --> 00:16:39,860
Don't release him until the bruises
on his hands and face have faded.

280
00:16:41,180 --> 00:16:42,260
On the day of his release,

281
00:16:42,740 --> 00:16:43,620
give him a bath,

282
00:16:43,860 --> 00:16:44,940
dress him in clean clothes,

283
00:16:45,420 --> 00:16:46,060
then send him out.

284
00:16:46,380 --> 00:16:48,940
Don't worry. I'll find him
the finest clothes!

285
00:16:54,820 --> 00:17:00,020
(Ten Days Later)

286
00:17:18,180 --> 00:17:19,060
(I think that's really him.)

287
00:17:20,500 --> 00:17:20,860
(Yintaimen)
Shang!

288
00:17:21,460 --> 00:17:21,900
Yan Shang!

289
00:17:22,180 --> 00:17:22,540
(Yan Shang!)

290
00:17:23,660 --> 00:17:24,020
Yan Shang!

291
00:17:24,820 --> 00:17:25,220
Wei Shu.

292
00:17:30,700 --> 00:17:31,140
I am

293
00:17:32,100 --> 00:17:32,940
deeply grateful to you all!

294
00:17:33,220 --> 00:17:35,220
(Yintaimen)

295
00:17:35,220 --> 00:17:36,180
Well, look at you, Yan Shang!

296
00:17:36,460 --> 00:17:37,860
After all those days at Yintaimen,

297
00:17:37,860 --> 00:17:38,740
you actually made it out alive!

298
00:17:39,180 --> 00:17:39,900
You've got nine lives!

299
00:17:41,820 --> 00:17:42,420
Let's talk at home.

300
00:17:43,580 --> 00:17:43,900
All right.

301
00:17:44,500 --> 00:17:44,820
Let's go.

302
00:17:47,260 --> 00:17:48,180
(Thank you! Thank you!)

303
00:17:48,180 --> 00:17:49,300
- (Scholar Yan!)
- (Thank goodness you're safe!)

304
00:17:49,300 --> 00:17:49,900
Thank you. Thank you.

305
00:17:49,900 --> 00:17:50,700
(Glad you're safe!)

306
00:17:50,700 --> 00:17:51,340
Thank you, everyone.

307
00:17:51,860 --> 00:17:52,340
Thank you.

308
00:17:52,820 --> 00:17:53,460
Thank you, everyone.

309
00:17:54,060 --> 00:17:54,700
- (Thank you.)
- Thank you.

310
00:17:55,180 --> 00:17:55,980
(Thank you.)

311
00:18:06,580 --> 00:18:07,060
Your Highness.

312
00:18:08,340 --> 00:18:09,180
You've saved my life again.

313
00:18:14,740 --> 00:18:15,700
My legs have gone numb.

314
00:18:18,300 --> 00:18:18,700
Completely numb.

315
00:18:19,220 --> 00:18:20,060
Now you know what pain feels like?

316
00:18:30,700 --> 00:18:31,500
Those monsters!

317
00:18:32,820 --> 00:18:33,380
It's all right.

318
00:18:34,060 --> 00:18:35,260
They're just superficial wounds.

319
00:18:35,620 --> 00:18:37,100
You nearly died! Do you realize that?

320
00:18:45,900 --> 00:18:48,260
I killed Zheng Xing to seek justice
for the people.

321
00:18:49,060 --> 00:18:49,820
After I was imprisoned,

322
00:18:50,100 --> 00:18:51,460
the people sought justice for me.

323
00:18:51,900 --> 00:18:53,140
It all worked out for the best.

324
00:18:53,940 --> 00:18:54,460
Your Highness,

325
00:18:55,140 --> 00:18:55,980
shouldn't you be happy?

326
00:19:00,060 --> 00:19:00,460
Listen.

327
00:19:01,020 --> 00:19:02,260
(It's all thanks to Scholar Yan.)

328
00:19:10,940 --> 00:19:12,860
(Who else would've stood up for us
but Scholar Yan?)

329
00:19:12,940 --> 00:19:14,140
(It's all thanks to Scholar Yan.)

330
00:19:14,940 --> 00:19:16,020
(What a good man.)

331
00:19:18,860 --> 00:19:19,980
To see so many people happy

332
00:19:20,540 --> 00:19:21,500
in times like these...

333
00:19:22,420 --> 00:19:23,580
How rare that is.

334
00:19:30,140 --> 00:19:31,300
I risked my life to get through this.

335
00:19:32,340 --> 00:19:32,820
From now on,

336
00:19:33,460 --> 00:19:34,540
the road ahead will be much smoother.

337
00:19:35,180 --> 00:19:36,540
I'll be able to do more for you.

338
00:19:37,700 --> 00:19:39,340
If that's what you expect of me,

339
00:19:40,300 --> 00:19:40,860
if...

340
00:19:42,180 --> 00:19:43,900
if that's the only thing
I can do for you...

341
00:19:46,900 --> 00:19:48,220
I'd rather you did nothing at all.

342
00:19:48,820 --> 00:19:49,580
Just stay alive.

343
00:19:50,300 --> 00:19:51,420
Go back to Lingnan and farm your land.

344
00:19:52,580 --> 00:19:54,540
Your future, the people's cheers,

345
00:19:54,820 --> 00:19:55,820
your so-called perfect outcome...

346
00:19:56,300 --> 00:19:57,580
Are any of those worth
more than your life?

347
00:19:59,100 --> 00:20:00,180
If you weren't so tough

348
00:20:00,740 --> 00:20:01,580
and incredibly lucky,

349
00:20:02,060 --> 00:20:04,260
you'd already be another
innocent soul dead at Yintaimen.

350
00:20:05,180 --> 00:20:06,580
Can't you see what really matters?

351
00:20:07,140 --> 00:20:08,140
What on earth were you thinking?

352
00:20:13,540 --> 00:20:13,980
But...

353
00:20:16,140 --> 00:20:17,260
You matter more than any of that.

354
00:20:21,260 --> 00:20:22,980
I can't bear to watch you
risk your life like this.

355
00:20:28,980 --> 00:20:29,460
Your Highness,

356
00:20:31,220 --> 00:20:32,420
we once sealed our vow with blood.

357
00:20:33,620 --> 00:20:34,660
No matter when or where,

358
00:20:35,220 --> 00:20:36,860
no matter how you feel about me,

359
00:20:38,020 --> 00:20:38,980
my feelings for you

360
00:20:39,900 --> 00:20:40,700
will never change.

361
00:20:43,780 --> 00:20:45,660
You can still think of me
as your adviser.

362
00:20:46,900 --> 00:20:47,900
I'll always stay by your side,

363
00:20:49,020 --> 00:20:49,940
protect you from harm,

364
00:20:50,820 --> 00:20:51,940
and remain within your reach,

365
00:20:52,860 --> 00:20:53,980
right where you can see me,

366
00:20:55,020 --> 00:20:55,780
always waiting for you.

367
00:20:59,820 --> 00:21:00,700
Whenever you're ready,

368
00:21:01,900 --> 00:21:03,060
you can tell me anything.

369
00:21:05,780 --> 00:21:07,140
I want to share your burdens.

370
00:21:12,500 --> 00:21:12,940
Yan Shang.

371
00:21:14,980 --> 00:21:15,660
Those words...

372
00:21:16,700 --> 00:21:17,460
That was beautifully said.

373
00:21:19,660 --> 00:21:20,180
Thank you.

374
00:21:20,180 --> 00:21:22,820
♪Let's conspire to grow old together♪

375
00:21:22,820 --> 00:21:23,380
But...

376
00:21:25,460 --> 00:21:27,020
I'm not a little girl anymore.

377
00:21:28,780 --> 00:21:30,380
A few sweet words won't make me

378
00:21:31,660 --> 00:21:32,580
throw caution to the wind.

379
00:21:32,580 --> 00:21:36,220
♪However deep the snow,
I'll wait if you're there♪

380
00:21:36,220 --> 00:21:39,900
♪However deep the snow,
I'll wait if you're there♪

381
00:21:40,020 --> 00:21:40,460
You're right.

382
00:21:41,060 --> 00:21:41,820
Words alone prove nothing.

383
00:21:43,140 --> 00:21:44,100
But I'll wait for the day

384
00:21:45,140 --> 00:21:46,140
when you finally believe me.

385
00:21:47,180 --> 00:21:52,780
♪Sharp winds or fierce rain,
nothing can break us♪

386
00:21:52,780 --> 00:21:53,220
All right.

387
00:21:54,380 --> 00:21:57,740
♪Be my one and only in this world;
be my one and only in this life♪

388
00:21:57,860 --> 00:22:01,220
♪My last untouched innocence♪

389
00:22:01,860 --> 00:22:04,260
(Imperial Physician Huang;
Palace Medical Service)

390
00:22:04,980 --> 00:22:06,020
Lie down!

391
00:22:09,460 --> 00:22:10,020
Imperial Physician Huang,

392
00:22:10,580 --> 00:22:11,100
take his pulse.

393
00:22:12,220 --> 00:22:12,700
Yes, Your Highness.

394
00:22:28,300 --> 00:22:30,020
Stay in bed and rest
for the next few days.

395
00:22:30,500 --> 00:22:32,220
This is Imperial Physician Huang
from the Imperial Medical Office.

396
00:22:32,620 --> 00:22:33,500
Every five days,

397
00:22:33,740 --> 00:22:35,060
he'll come to check your pulse

398
00:22:35,580 --> 00:22:36,340
and adjust your prescription.

399
00:22:36,820 --> 00:22:37,900
Take your medicine properly.

400
00:22:38,780 --> 00:22:40,300
Otherwise, you could suffer
lasting damage

401
00:22:41,060 --> 00:22:41,940
and regret it for the rest of your life.

402
00:22:44,420 --> 00:22:45,180
Thank you, Your Highness.

403
00:22:48,540 --> 00:22:50,180
Then you'd better think carefully

404
00:22:51,220 --> 00:22:52,260
about how you're going to thank me.

405
00:23:10,020 --> 00:23:10,860
Thank you for your trouble,
Imperial Physician Huang.

406
00:24:05,820 --> 00:24:06,220
Yan Shang!

407
00:24:06,940 --> 00:24:07,540
Are you home?

408
00:24:09,260 --> 00:24:09,980
Still alive?

409
00:24:10,980 --> 00:24:11,420
Who's there?

410
00:24:12,700 --> 00:24:13,340
Oh, someone's home!

411
00:24:14,180 --> 00:24:14,980
I'm coming in, then.

412
00:24:19,780 --> 00:24:20,580
You can walk already?

413
00:24:23,340 --> 00:24:23,820
Who's this?

414
00:24:24,300 --> 00:24:25,220
I should be asking you that!

415
00:24:25,580 --> 00:24:26,660
The host hasn't invited you in,

416
00:24:26,740 --> 00:24:27,700
yet you just barged right in!

417
00:24:30,740 --> 00:24:31,220
Yang Si,

418
00:24:31,900 --> 00:24:32,340
this is

419
00:24:32,860 --> 00:24:33,540
my friend,

420
00:24:34,020 --> 00:24:34,740
Liu Wenji.

421
00:24:35,540 --> 00:24:36,020
Wenji.

422
00:24:37,060 --> 00:24:37,540
This is...

423
00:24:41,180 --> 00:24:42,060
also my friend.

424
00:24:45,180 --> 00:24:45,980
I came looking for Wanyao.

425
00:24:46,820 --> 00:24:47,700
She's not at her residence.

426
00:24:47,860 --> 00:24:48,740
I thought perhaps...

427
00:24:50,380 --> 00:24:51,380
She's not here either.

428
00:25:00,020 --> 00:25:01,780
When people were trying to save you,

429
00:25:02,260 --> 00:25:03,180
they drew up a petition.

430
00:25:04,500 --> 00:25:05,540
I signed it too, you know.

431
00:25:07,140 --> 00:25:07,860
Thank you, Yang Si.

432
00:25:09,020 --> 00:25:10,140
I never expected

433
00:25:10,620 --> 00:25:11,620
that piece of paper to actually work.

434
00:25:13,460 --> 00:25:13,900
Third-Place Scholar,

435
00:25:14,180 --> 00:25:15,460
aren't you great with words?

436
00:25:15,820 --> 00:25:17,060
Write an anonymous denunciation

437
00:25:17,300 --> 00:25:17,980
and tear Yu Cheng'an to shreds!

438
00:25:18,820 --> 00:25:19,260
He mustn't!

439
00:25:20,220 --> 00:25:21,620
Yintaimen's spies are everywhere.

440
00:25:22,140 --> 00:25:22,660
If he's discovered,

441
00:25:22,980 --> 00:25:23,740
Shang may lose his life.

442
00:25:26,020 --> 00:25:29,100
Only heaven and the three of us
would know.

443
00:25:30,340 --> 00:25:31,020
If someone reports him,

444
00:25:31,620 --> 00:25:32,780
it must have been you.

445
00:25:32,780 --> 00:25:33,060
Me?

446
00:25:33,940 --> 00:25:34,940
Why would I ever betray Shang?

447
00:25:35,100 --> 00:25:36,100
Why wouldn't you?

448
00:25:36,700 --> 00:25:38,100
You never know someone's
true intentions.

449
00:25:38,100 --> 00:25:39,620
You're the one with suspicious motives.

450
00:25:39,620 --> 00:25:41,020
How am I the suspicious one?

451
00:25:41,020 --> 00:25:42,100
You started it!

452
00:25:42,340 --> 00:25:43,820
You can't just accuse me!
What do you mean, I started it?

453
00:25:43,820 --> 00:25:44,980
- How am I accusing you?
- You said it first!

454
00:25:44,980 --> 00:25:46,660
Enough! Both of you, stop arguing.

455
00:25:46,900 --> 00:25:47,380
Yan Shang!

456
00:25:48,060 --> 00:25:48,660
Are you home?

457
00:25:52,780 --> 00:25:53,980
It's quite lively here today!

458
00:25:54,900 --> 00:25:56,140
(This is Yan Shang's home.)

459
00:25:56,140 --> 00:25:57,260
I went to the Imperial Academy today.

460
00:25:57,660 --> 00:25:59,140
The Academy Director asked me
to give you this letter.

461
00:25:59,140 --> 00:25:59,740
(You're just as loud.)

462
00:25:59,740 --> 00:26:00,300
He also said...

463
00:26:00,420 --> 00:26:00,820
(Why do you keep picking on me?)

464
00:26:00,820 --> 00:26:01,700
he was delivering it for someone else.

465
00:26:01,900 --> 00:26:03,300
- (Why would Shang befriend...)
- (What do you mean?)

466
00:26:03,620 --> 00:26:04,780
(Go on, say it! I dare you!)

467
00:26:05,300 --> 00:26:05,900
(I won't argue with you.)

468
00:26:06,500 --> 00:26:07,340
(Yan Shang hasn't fully recovered.)

469
00:26:07,660 --> 00:26:08,180
(He needs peace and quiet.)

470
00:26:08,180 --> 00:26:09,220
(You're just losing the argument!)

471
00:26:09,220 --> 00:26:11,820
(When shall we play Go together again?)

472
00:26:12,380 --> 00:26:15,540
(Surely you'd like to win one back,
young man?)

473
00:26:15,940 --> 00:26:18,500
(Liu Residence, Southeast Xuanyang Ward)

474
00:26:19,420 --> 00:26:20,260
(It's Chancellor Liu.)

475
00:26:20,780 --> 00:26:21,860
(He must want to see me
about something.)

476
00:26:23,780 --> 00:26:24,500
Thank you, Wei Shu.

477
00:26:25,060 --> 00:26:25,860
I need to go out.

478
00:26:25,940 --> 00:26:29,660
(Liu Residence)

479
00:26:29,660 --> 00:26:31,020
I, Yan Shang, request an audience.

480
00:26:32,780 --> 00:26:33,660
Come up.

481
00:27:07,180 --> 00:27:07,700
Chancellor Liu,

482
00:27:08,460 --> 00:27:09,140
I hope you've been well.

483
00:27:12,620 --> 00:27:14,260
Have you recovered

484
00:27:14,620 --> 00:27:15,500
from your injuries at Yintaimen?

485
00:27:16,020 --> 00:27:16,660
I'm fine now.

486
00:27:22,700 --> 00:27:24,180
I regret my decision.

487
00:27:28,060 --> 00:27:29,140
Do you regret

488
00:27:29,780 --> 00:27:30,780
inviting me to play Go?

489
00:27:31,380 --> 00:27:32,700
I regret stopping

490
00:27:33,460 --> 00:27:35,660
a reckless little brat like you

491
00:27:36,300 --> 00:27:38,900
from leaving that day!

492
00:27:42,220 --> 00:27:43,380
That day outside the city,

493
00:27:43,900 --> 00:27:46,060
you had two choices, leave or stay.

494
00:27:46,820 --> 00:27:48,100
You chose to stay.

495
00:27:49,860 --> 00:27:51,380
What exactly are you
trying to accomplish?

496
00:27:55,820 --> 00:27:56,660
With traitors ruling the realm,

497
00:27:57,660 --> 00:27:59,660
if I merely avenged
my personal grievance

498
00:27:59,940 --> 00:28:00,900
and withdrew into seclusion,

499
00:28:02,060 --> 00:28:03,340
I'd contribute nothing in life

500
00:28:03,940 --> 00:28:05,020
and leave no legacy in death.

501
00:28:05,820 --> 00:28:06,660
Wouldn't that be shameful?

502
00:28:07,860 --> 00:28:09,060
Then let me ask you,

503
00:28:09,820 --> 00:28:11,300
once you enter official service,

504
00:28:11,860 --> 00:28:12,780
what do you intend to do?

505
00:28:13,380 --> 00:28:14,020
Punish the tyrants.

506
00:28:14,660 --> 00:28:15,340
Restore order.

507
00:28:16,180 --> 00:28:16,660
Serve the people.

508
00:28:17,300 --> 00:28:17,820
Uphold justice.

509
00:28:18,820 --> 00:28:19,420
Practice benevolence.

510
00:28:20,540 --> 00:28:21,060
Serve the common good.

511
00:28:21,660 --> 00:28:23,740
Yet you act so recklessly!

512
00:28:24,420 --> 00:28:25,700
You don't know when to hold back,

513
00:28:26,220 --> 00:28:27,620
bringing disaster upon yourself.

514
00:28:28,500 --> 00:28:31,140
You nearly died in prison

515
00:28:31,860 --> 00:28:33,260
just to kill an insignificant
Zheng Xing.

516
00:28:34,060 --> 00:28:35,860
What right have you
to speak of such ideals?

517
00:28:37,820 --> 00:28:38,380
I...

518
00:28:39,460 --> 00:28:40,540
I had a plan

519
00:28:42,100 --> 00:28:42,820
before I acted.

520
00:28:43,980 --> 00:28:44,860
Though it was dangerous,

521
00:28:45,460 --> 00:28:46,380
there was still a chance of survival.

522
00:28:47,060 --> 00:28:48,220
That's why I made that choice.

523
00:28:48,980 --> 00:28:50,140
A chance of survival?

524
00:28:52,780 --> 00:28:56,500
You mean the signatures of hundreds
of Imperial Academy students

525
00:28:57,220 --> 00:29:00,020
and the fingerprints of thousands
of commoners?

526
00:29:03,300 --> 00:29:03,780
Yes.

527
00:29:04,060 --> 00:29:05,420
You planned all along

528
00:29:05,980 --> 00:29:07,260
to stir up public opinion

529
00:29:07,740 --> 00:29:09,380
and use it to save yourself?

530
00:29:10,300 --> 00:29:10,660
Yes.

531
00:29:15,580 --> 00:29:17,580
You manipulated the people's trust.

532
00:29:17,700 --> 00:29:19,700
That makes you deceitful
and treacherous,

533
00:29:20,380 --> 00:29:22,140
even worse than a reckless fool!

534
00:29:23,700 --> 00:29:24,740
Please enlighten me, Chancellor.

535
00:29:25,540 --> 00:29:27,220
Yan Shang, Yan Shang...

536
00:29:28,580 --> 00:29:29,940
The hearts and minds of the people

537
00:29:30,420 --> 00:29:33,500
won't always bend to your calculations.

538
00:29:34,180 --> 00:29:35,540
One wrong move,

539
00:29:36,140 --> 00:29:38,700
and you'll meet a terrible end!

540
00:29:43,820 --> 00:29:46,540
You certainly have a calculating mind,

541
00:29:47,620 --> 00:29:48,900
just like your style of Go.

542
00:29:49,500 --> 00:29:51,220
Your moves seem conventional,

543
00:29:51,780 --> 00:29:53,900
then suddenly catch me off guard

544
00:29:54,140 --> 00:29:55,540
with a daring, risky move.

545
00:29:57,940 --> 00:29:58,940
You're too kind, Chancellor.

546
00:29:59,980 --> 00:30:01,860
It's too early to be modest!

547
00:30:02,660 --> 00:30:03,220
Yan Shang,

548
00:30:03,940 --> 00:30:05,340
you're exceptionally intelligent,

549
00:30:05,620 --> 00:30:06,660
yet when we play Go,

550
00:30:07,260 --> 00:30:09,620
you lose far more often than you win.

551
00:30:10,660 --> 00:30:12,740
Have you ever wondered why?

552
00:30:14,100 --> 00:30:15,940
Your style is steady and measured.

553
00:30:16,580 --> 00:30:18,060
You often even yield ground to me.

554
00:30:18,660 --> 00:30:19,180
But...

555
00:30:20,380 --> 00:30:21,540
But by the end of the game,

556
00:30:24,220 --> 00:30:25,020
I always discover

557
00:30:25,340 --> 00:30:26,900
that your white stones
form a dense forest,

558
00:30:27,180 --> 00:30:27,780
a treacherous swamp,

559
00:30:28,980 --> 00:30:30,220
and have already trapped

560
00:30:31,140 --> 00:30:31,980
my black stones beyond escape.

561
00:30:33,540 --> 00:30:35,940
Sometimes cleverness
becomes your downfall.

562
00:30:37,100 --> 00:30:40,140
Better to take steady steps,
even if you seem foolish.

563
00:30:42,620 --> 00:30:43,740
Thank you for your guidance, Chancellor.

564
00:30:45,020 --> 00:30:45,900
You've taught me the way of Go.

565
00:30:47,580 --> 00:30:48,380
Be patient now

566
00:30:49,180 --> 00:30:50,140
for the sake of the long game.

567
00:30:52,260 --> 00:30:53,100
I understand.

568
00:30:53,300 --> 00:30:54,820
Is that all you've learned?

569
00:30:57,260 --> 00:30:58,980
When I called you back that day,

570
00:30:59,900 --> 00:31:01,620
I wasn't entirely certain
of my decision.

571
00:31:02,420 --> 00:31:03,620
With a mind like yours,

572
00:31:04,180 --> 00:31:05,780
if you turned to evil,

573
00:31:06,340 --> 00:31:08,260
you'd become a grave threat
to the realm.

574
00:31:10,740 --> 00:31:11,740
So I thought,

575
00:31:12,580 --> 00:31:13,380
this young man...

576
00:31:13,860 --> 00:31:16,620
I must put him to the test.

577
00:31:20,060 --> 00:31:20,620
Then...

578
00:31:21,540 --> 00:31:23,020
what's your verdict, Chancellor?

579
00:31:24,660 --> 00:31:25,740
You little rascal...

580
00:31:31,020 --> 00:31:31,500
You passed.

581
00:31:37,700 --> 00:31:38,180
Chancellor,

582
00:31:39,300 --> 00:31:40,180
I've always believed

583
00:31:40,580 --> 00:31:41,380
that not everyone in
or outside the Court

584
00:31:41,660 --> 00:31:43,020
is a vile scoundrel.

585
00:31:44,100 --> 00:31:46,060
If we can rid the realm of lackeys
like Zheng Xing,

586
00:31:46,620 --> 00:31:47,780
and even the predators behind them,

587
00:31:48,660 --> 00:31:49,180
the Huai Dynasty

588
00:31:50,100 --> 00:31:51,820
will one day be free of corruption.

589
00:31:58,620 --> 00:32:00,180
Why are you still standing?

590
00:32:01,260 --> 00:32:03,820
Haven't your injuries from Yintaimen
healed yet?

591
00:32:13,180 --> 00:32:13,700
Master,

592
00:32:14,580 --> 00:32:15,540
I, Yan Shang,

593
00:32:16,100 --> 00:32:16,980
pay my respects to you.

594
00:32:40,060 --> 00:32:40,700
Very good!

595
00:32:41,300 --> 00:32:41,900
Rise.

596
00:32:42,740 --> 00:32:44,060
From this day forward,

597
00:32:44,700 --> 00:32:46,820
you shall be my disciple.

598
00:32:47,900 --> 00:32:48,460
Yan Shang,

599
00:32:48,940 --> 00:32:49,700
do you have a courtesy name?

600
00:32:50,300 --> 00:32:51,180
Not yet, Master.

601
00:32:53,420 --> 00:32:54,620
The character "Shang"

602
00:32:54,860 --> 00:32:55,940
signifies aspiration

603
00:32:56,420 --> 00:32:57,540
and the will to help others.

604
00:32:58,980 --> 00:32:59,820
Then your courtesy name

605
00:33:00,540 --> 00:33:01,420
shall be Suchen.

606
00:33:02,420 --> 00:33:03,900
May you stay true to your principles

607
00:33:04,460 --> 00:33:06,660
and serve Confucius, the Uncrowned King.

608
00:33:09,100 --> 00:33:09,900
Thank you, Master.

609
00:33:12,500 --> 00:33:13,140
Sit down.

610
00:33:14,620 --> 00:33:15,580
Finish this game

611
00:33:16,220 --> 00:33:18,060
of Go with your master.

612
00:33:20,300 --> 00:33:20,700
Yes, Master.

613
00:33:43,460 --> 00:33:44,300
Imperial Physician Huang,
a moment, please.

614
00:33:45,500 --> 00:33:46,380
Miss Chunhua.

615
00:33:46,900 --> 00:33:48,580
Does the princess
have further instructions?

616
00:33:49,540 --> 00:33:50,380
It's not the princess.

617
00:33:52,460 --> 00:33:53,020
Imperial Physician Huang,

618
00:33:54,340 --> 00:33:55,140
could you please

619
00:33:55,780 --> 00:33:56,620
take my pulse

620
00:33:57,260 --> 00:33:58,180
before seeing Yan Shang?

621
00:33:59,220 --> 00:33:59,780
Please.

622
00:34:00,780 --> 00:34:02,340
Of course, Miss Chunhua.

623
00:34:02,780 --> 00:34:03,580
Give me your wrist.

624
00:34:04,020 --> 00:34:05,180
Are you feeling unwell?

625
00:34:15,660 --> 00:34:16,300
Imperial Physician Huang,

626
00:34:19,500 --> 00:34:20,340
my period

627
00:34:21,500 --> 00:34:22,500
was due at the start of the month.

628
00:34:23,820 --> 00:34:24,660
But I've been waiting,

629
00:34:25,700 --> 00:34:26,420
and it still hasn't come.

630
00:34:27,540 --> 00:34:28,580
It's nothing to worry about.

631
00:34:28,580 --> 00:34:29,980
You're still young.

632
00:34:30,700 --> 00:34:32,620
Stress or exhaustion
could cause a delay.

633
00:34:43,380 --> 00:34:44,380
(Miss, did you know)

634
00:34:46,140 --> 00:34:47,180
(you're pregnant?)

635
00:35:00,780 --> 00:35:04,540
(Cinnabar, Eucommia Bark, Tin, Mercury)

636
00:35:07,100 --> 00:35:13,540
(Mercury)

637
00:35:16,220 --> 00:35:17,380
(Mercury heated in oil.
And taken as a date-sized pill)

638
00:35:19,180 --> 00:35:20,700
(Mercury)
(on an empty stomach)

639
00:35:22,260 --> 00:35:23,340
(causes permanent infertility.)

640
00:35:23,460 --> 00:35:24,060
It's mercury.

641
00:35:46,740 --> 00:35:47,380
Imperial Physician Huang,

642
00:35:47,980 --> 00:35:48,740
what's happening?

643
00:35:52,180 --> 00:35:52,900
Your Highness,

644
00:35:53,580 --> 00:35:54,540
Miss Chunhua

645
00:35:55,460 --> 00:35:56,900
most likely took

646
00:35:56,900 --> 00:35:58,740
some dangerous medicine
to end her pregnancy,

647
00:35:59,420 --> 00:36:00,980
causing uncontrollable bleeding.

648
00:36:02,020 --> 00:36:02,820
Right now,

649
00:36:05,020 --> 00:36:05,860
her condition is critical.

650
00:36:16,300 --> 00:36:16,860
Chunhua!

651
00:36:17,540 --> 00:36:18,140
Chunhua!

652
00:36:20,620 --> 00:36:21,420
What did you take?

653
00:36:24,740 --> 00:36:25,500
Your Highness...

654
00:36:27,860 --> 00:36:28,940
I...

655
00:36:30,860 --> 00:36:32,060
I did something foolish after all.

656
00:36:38,980 --> 00:36:39,700
Your Highness.

657
00:36:42,980 --> 00:36:43,460
I...

658
00:36:45,420 --> 00:36:46,620
I don't want to die.

659
00:36:47,140 --> 00:36:47,780
Tell me.

660
00:36:48,860 --> 00:36:49,500
Was it...

661
00:36:51,140 --> 00:36:52,300
Was it mercury heated in oil?

662
00:36:55,900 --> 00:36:56,420
Yes.

663
00:36:57,940 --> 00:36:58,740
I'll save you.

664
00:36:59,380 --> 00:37:00,460
I won't let you die.

665
00:37:01,220 --> 00:37:01,780
Imperial Physician Huang.

666
00:37:02,380 --> 00:37:02,860
Come with me.

667
00:37:15,260 --> 00:37:15,860
Chunhua.

668
00:37:18,900 --> 00:37:19,260
Here.

669
00:37:47,540 --> 00:37:48,300
Is this...

670
00:37:50,460 --> 00:37:51,820
from when you were in North Jing?

671
00:37:53,820 --> 00:37:54,100
Yes.

672
00:37:55,500 --> 00:37:56,380
The very same prescription.

673
00:37:58,180 --> 00:37:58,780
Fortunately, this time

674
00:37:59,420 --> 00:38:00,460
we're in Sheng'an.

675
00:38:01,420 --> 00:38:02,340
We have all the ingredients.

676
00:38:10,460 --> 00:38:10,940
Chunhua.

677
00:38:12,340 --> 00:38:14,100
Do you want to save your life
or end the pregnancy?

678
00:38:15,460 --> 00:38:16,100
Your Highness,

679
00:38:19,740 --> 00:38:21,420
I don't want to have a child.

680
00:38:24,460 --> 00:38:25,260
I just want

681
00:38:27,380 --> 00:38:28,740
to stay by your side.

682
00:38:34,020 --> 00:38:34,580
Drink this.

683
00:38:46,140 --> 00:38:48,100
If you want to live, you must drink it.

684
00:39:36,700 --> 00:39:37,300
Your Highness...

685
00:39:40,220 --> 00:39:41,940
Back when you were in North Jing...

686
00:39:47,540 --> 00:39:49,180
I never knew it hurt this much.

687
00:40:01,220 --> 00:40:03,260
Your Highness, the pharmacy
has all the other ingredients.

688
00:40:03,420 --> 00:40:04,940
Only the most important one,
jade poria, is missing!

689
00:40:05,300 --> 00:40:06,300
I slipped out

690
00:40:06,660 --> 00:40:08,420
and searched every pharmacy in the city.
None had it!

691
00:40:08,860 --> 00:40:10,660
They said jade poria doesn't grow
in North Jing.

692
00:40:11,900 --> 00:40:12,860
Your Highness, what do we do?

693
00:40:16,500 --> 00:40:17,860
Go find him, quickly.

694
00:40:18,420 --> 00:40:18,820
All right!

695
00:40:19,140 --> 00:40:19,740
I'll go right now.

696
00:40:20,260 --> 00:40:21,060
Your Highness, wait for me.

697
00:40:47,020 --> 00:40:48,460
This antidote pill made
from jade poria...

698
00:40:50,580 --> 00:40:51,460
I happen to have one.

699
00:40:53,420 --> 00:40:55,580
But if you take this antidote,

700
00:40:57,140 --> 00:40:58,580
it will save your life

701
00:41:00,060 --> 00:41:01,900
and preserve the child in your womb.

702
00:41:12,660 --> 00:41:13,380
Tonight,

703
00:41:15,540 --> 00:41:17,060
only one of us will survive.

704
00:41:20,340 --> 00:41:21,660
And that will be me.

705
00:41:24,300 --> 00:41:24,820
Your Highness.

706
00:41:26,180 --> 00:41:27,100
Your Highness, please don't die.

707
00:41:27,660 --> 00:41:29,140
Don't leave me all alone.

708
00:41:30,540 --> 00:41:31,980
I have to survive.

709
00:41:35,500 --> 00:41:36,620
One day,

710
00:41:39,620 --> 00:41:40,820
I promise I'll take you

711
00:41:42,940 --> 00:41:44,060
away from North Jing

712
00:41:44,580 --> 00:41:45,780
and back to Sheng'an.

713
00:41:49,940 --> 00:41:50,620
Your Highness,

714
00:41:53,380 --> 00:41:54,780
you really did it.

715
00:41:57,460 --> 00:41:58,780
You brought me home.

716
00:42:00,260 --> 00:42:01,860
Even now, I still don't know

717
00:42:02,980 --> 00:42:04,780
how you managed it.

718
00:42:07,660 --> 00:42:08,700
When you've recovered,

719
00:42:09,940 --> 00:42:10,940
ask me again.

720
00:42:12,420 --> 00:42:13,220
Then I'll tell you.

721
00:42:22,980 --> 00:42:23,700
Your Highness,

722
00:42:25,020 --> 00:42:25,980
I feel like

723
00:42:27,660 --> 00:42:29,260
I'm back there again.

724
00:42:31,260 --> 00:42:33,100
On our journey home...

725
00:42:35,100 --> 00:42:36,540
The snow was so heavy.

726
00:42:38,980 --> 00:42:39,860
So cold...

727
00:42:46,260 --> 00:42:47,180
It's such a long way.

728
00:42:48,020 --> 00:42:49,700
Can we really make it back to Sheng'an?

729
00:42:50,540 --> 00:42:51,140
We can.

730
00:42:51,460 --> 00:42:51,900
I...

731
00:42:55,260 --> 00:42:56,180
I can't go on.

732
00:42:56,180 --> 00:43:00,020
♪Into savage lands, to tame tigers
and slay wolves♪

733
00:43:00,020 --> 00:43:01,940
That hunter's trap was so powerful.

734
00:43:02,780 --> 00:43:05,780
I think the bones in my foot are broken.

735
00:43:10,780 --> 00:43:11,380
Your Highness,

736
00:43:11,980 --> 00:43:13,340
I still have some food.

737
00:43:13,980 --> 00:43:14,820
Take it with you.

738
00:43:15,620 --> 00:43:16,940
Maybe if you eat enough,

739
00:43:17,540 --> 00:43:18,300
you'll have the strength to walk faster

740
00:43:19,420 --> 00:43:21,020
and make it back to Sheng'an.

741
00:43:25,900 --> 00:43:26,460
Your Highness,

742
00:43:28,260 --> 00:43:29,700
if you make it back to Sheng'an,

743
00:43:30,940 --> 00:43:32,580
please don't forget me.

744
00:43:34,340 --> 00:43:36,380
Remember to burn some spirit money
for me every year.

745
00:43:36,980 --> 00:43:37,820
My mother said

746
00:43:39,100 --> 00:43:41,020
if no one burns spirit money for you,

747
00:43:42,100 --> 00:43:44,100
you'll become a wandering ghost.

748
00:43:45,740 --> 00:43:49,980
♪With sacrificed innocence
and a soul snowbound♪

749
00:43:50,140 --> 00:43:51,420
♪If the road is blocked,
I'll fight my way through♪

750
00:43:51,420 --> 00:43:51,740
Let's go.

751
00:43:52,700 --> 00:43:55,820
♪Cut down the crowd,
strike down the proud gods♪

752
00:43:55,980 --> 00:43:59,060
♪Break through Hell's gates♪

753
00:44:01,100 --> 00:44:02,980
I really can't take another step.

754
00:44:04,260 --> 00:44:05,060
Go on without me.

755
00:44:05,700 --> 00:44:07,820
Leave me. It'll be dark soon.

756
00:44:08,180 --> 00:44:08,860
Don't be ridiculous.

757
00:44:09,460 --> 00:44:09,780
Come on!

758
00:44:14,020 --> 00:44:17,820
♪Though this world is hard to cross,
I'll lead you through♪

759
00:44:17,940 --> 00:44:20,980
♪I dare face the unknown,
with my sword in hand♪

760
00:44:21,260 --> 00:44:25,980
♪I'll guard my princess,
and keep her tears at bay♪

761
00:44:33,300 --> 00:44:37,100
♪You're my princess,
and I'll take you away♪

762
00:44:37,220 --> 00:44:40,300
♪In this life, we'll bow
only to flowers♪

763
00:44:40,540 --> 00:44:46,380
♪Fierce and radiant,
red lips and dark eyes♪

764
00:44:46,660 --> 00:44:50,700
♪Together we'll climb the city walls♪

765
00:45:12,460 --> 00:45:17,140
(Next Episode Preview)

766
00:45:17,460 --> 00:45:18,500
I've thought of two ways

767
00:45:19,220 --> 00:45:20,580
to keep you out of Yintaimen.

768
00:45:21,380 --> 00:45:22,020
What are they?

769
00:45:22,380 --> 00:45:23,020
The first

770
00:45:23,420 --> 00:45:24,460
is to have Liu Wenji take you away.

771
00:45:26,420 --> 00:45:27,740
What's the second?

772
00:45:29,300 --> 00:45:30,100
Marry the Prince of Jin.

773
00:45:31,700 --> 00:45:32,540
That will save your life.

774
00:45:36,080 --> 00:45:39,373
♪Be the ferry
where you wait for the sun♪

775
00:45:42,058 --> 00:45:46,974
♪Be the blue silk
that catches your tears♪

776
00:45:49,168 --> 00:45:55,013
♪Be the sleeve we held,
worn by dust and years♪

777
00:45:55,513 --> 00:46:00,739
♪Let's conspire to grow old together♪

778
00:46:03,508 --> 00:46:08,299
♪Let me be a captive beast
bound by the same lock as you♪

779
00:46:09,135 --> 00:46:15,214
♪- Through trails of mud and blood;
- let grief drown in your eyes♪

780
00:46:17,015 --> 00:46:20,165
♪Soar with the wind;
plunge into hellfire as one♪

781
00:46:20,165 --> 00:46:21,813
♪Burning bright as a song♪

782
00:46:21,865 --> 00:46:25,589
♪See how roses and green bamboo enchant♪

783
00:46:25,967 --> 00:46:30,633
♪Be the vow I make with all my heart♪

784
00:46:31,252 --> 00:46:35,293
♪If we say forever,
then forever it shall be♪

785
00:46:35,784 --> 00:46:37,899
♪Not a single hour less♪

786
00:46:37,939 --> 00:46:44,885
♪However deep the snow,
I'll wait if you're there♪

787
00:46:45,648 --> 00:46:49,101
♪We'll be gods above,
or wandering souls♪

788
00:46:49,281 --> 00:46:52,426
♪In heaven or the underworld,
you're all I need♪

789
00:46:52,865 --> 00:46:59,502
♪If we can stay, let's return
to the village of our first meeting♪

790
00:46:59,899 --> 00:47:01,937
♪- May time be free of fear;
- boats rock♪

791
00:47:01,937 --> 00:47:04,413
♪- May time be free of pain;
- lights fade, seasons turn♪

792
00:47:04,451 --> 00:47:06,920
♪You're the only one I need♪

793
00:47:07,124 --> 00:47:14,011
♪Sharp winds or fierce rain,
nothing can break us♪

794
00:47:14,323 --> 00:47:17,594
♪Be mine in this world;
be mine in this life♪

795
00:47:17,899 --> 00:47:21,072
♪My last untouched innocence♪

796
00:47:21,396 --> 00:47:24,822
♪If only we could return
to the village where we first met♪

797
00:47:25,055 --> 00:47:28,280
♪Stay by me; help me forget
the frozen dream of last night♪

798
00:47:28,611 --> 00:47:35,407
♪Fireflies glow, flowers kiss our lips;
just us, through dawn and dusk♪

799
00:47:35,776 --> 00:47:37,838
♪- May time be free of fear;
- boats rock♪

800
00:47:37,839 --> 00:47:40,342
♪- May time be free of pain;
- lights fade, seasons turn♪

801
00:47:40,389 --> 00:47:42,727
♪You're the only one I need♪

802
00:47:42,958 --> 00:47:49,793
♪By your side, through joy and pain,
is that eternity?♪

803
00:47:50,142 --> 00:47:51,760
♪Till fireworks flood the town♪

804
00:47:51,890 --> 00:47:53,686
♪Till the lake is still and clear♪

805
00:47:54,043 --> 00:47:57,060
♪You're the only one I need♪

806
00:47:57,100 --> 00:47:58,427
(No animals were harmed
or mistreated in production.)
